WEBVTT

00:00:13.550 --> 00:00:16.760
Wow, I can't believe how big it is.

00:00:16.930 --> 00:00:18.890
Are we going to walk across it?

00:00:19.390 --> 00:00:22.310
Ryoku-chan said to follow these roots.

00:00:22.520 --> 00:00:24.390
Ai-chan is pointing that way too.

00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:28.070
There might actually be some water.
Let's go.

00:00:29.020 --> 00:00:35.820
Inside the dark my heartbeat echoes

00:00:36.030 --> 00:00:42.700
Long night will continue on

00:00:42.870 --> 00:00:46.290
Time to face the hell that surrounds you
Before you crash and burn

00:00:46.460 --> 00:00:49.670
Within the fire
Your soul will rise now

00:01:02.770 --> 00:01:09.110
Breathe in, breathe out
Your blank gaze on the brink of life

00:01:09.310 --> 00:01:15.900
Step hard on the accelerator now
Escape the tunnel and overtake that pain

00:01:16.070 --> 00:01:22.910
A shadow disappears into smoke

00:01:23.080 --> 00:01:30.750
Lost light will continue on tomorrow

00:01:30.920 --> 00:01:37.880
Someday our world will change
Inside a fantasy Remember, remember

00:01:38.050 --> 00:01:44.980
I will mercilessly break your dream
and steal it away, with these hands

00:01:45.180 --> 00:01:51.360
Until this body breaks
Beyond the limit We'll never surrender

00:01:51.570 --> 00:01:54.780
Endless agony

00:01:55.240 --> 00:01:59.030
Finding my life in the KEMURIKUSA

00:02:03.200 --> 00:02:08.080
Oh, but this is actually
quite higher than I thought...

00:02:08.330 --> 00:02:10.580
What would happen if I fell?

00:02:11.170 --> 00:02:12.250
There.

00:02:15.840 --> 00:02:17.050
Seems safe.

00:02:17.220 --> 00:02:19.590
It's nice and strong.

00:02:19.760 --> 00:02:23.140
-It sure is huge.
-Never seen anything like it.

00:02:23.310 --> 00:02:24.600
It's like a boulder.

00:02:26.430 --> 00:02:30.560
This is so scary...
Please don't shake it like that.

00:02:30.940 --> 00:02:32.310
Off we go.

00:02:32.480 --> 00:02:33.690
Island Seven.

00:02:33.860 --> 00:02:36.150
-Seven it is!
-Yay!

00:02:36.320 --> 00:02:39.990
Please, stop doing that!

00:02:54.000 --> 00:02:55.840
There's hardly any red fog.

00:02:56.460 --> 00:02:59.880
It should be safe enough
to go inside the fog.

00:03:00.090 --> 00:03:03.220
You're right.
It's almost completely white.

00:03:03.390 --> 00:03:05.890
Maybe it has something to do
with the tree.

00:03:06.310 --> 00:03:08.350
But there aren't any leaves.

00:03:08.520 --> 00:03:10.310
All branches and no leaves.

00:03:10.480 --> 00:03:14.360
Seems like it's pretty much withered.
That's too bad.

00:03:14.520 --> 00:03:18.190
This is Midori-chan too? How amazing!

00:03:18.690 --> 00:03:21.070
My Midori-chan is amazing too!

00:03:21.240 --> 00:03:24.530
Mine has a better shine and sound.

00:03:25.490 --> 00:03:28.290
Really? Seems the same to me.

00:03:28.450 --> 00:03:32.500
It's not! They're totally different.

00:03:41.510 --> 00:03:44.340
I wonder if humans lived here too.

00:03:44.680 --> 00:03:49.270
There are buildings here.
Looks like this tree grew after that.

00:03:49.560 --> 00:03:54.770
This is my first time on Island Seven,
but it sure is strange.

00:03:55.150 --> 00:03:59.650
This tree too.
And there isn't any red fog around here.

00:04:00.190 --> 00:04:02.530
We don't know much, so be careful.

00:04:02.700 --> 00:04:04.820
-Okay!
-Sure!

00:04:05.280 --> 00:04:06.490
How's Ai-chan?

00:04:06.660 --> 00:04:09.370
It's pointing towards the root.

00:04:09.750 --> 00:04:11.870
It's getting more energetic too.

00:04:12.330 --> 00:04:16.170
A lake is where
there's a lot of water, right?

00:04:16.420 --> 00:04:18.170
I wonder how big it is.

00:04:18.340 --> 00:04:20.380
About as big as all that?

00:04:21.380 --> 00:04:23.180
That humongous?

00:04:23.380 --> 00:04:24.760
Can't imagine that.

00:04:24.930 --> 00:04:28.350
We'd never have to worry
about water again.

00:04:29.060 --> 00:04:33.310
I remember Ryoku-chan talking about
something called a river too.

00:04:33.480 --> 00:04:37.060
She said water kept flowing,
and you could take all you want.

00:04:37.230 --> 00:04:38.900
That's like a dreamland.

00:04:39.070 --> 00:04:42.820
Ryoku-chan sounds like a bit of a dreamer.

00:04:43.450 --> 00:04:46.490
But it doesn't feel like
water is close by.

00:04:46.740 --> 00:04:48.370
Maybe it's all gone.

00:04:48.700 --> 00:04:50.830
No, look at Ai.

00:04:51.200 --> 00:04:54.460
Come to think of it,
where did you find Ai-chan, Wakaba?

00:04:54.620 --> 00:04:56.040
Yeah, lucky you.

00:04:58.340 --> 00:05:01.800
Sis Riku was always the one
who found them for us.

00:05:01.960 --> 00:05:05.300
Sis Riku was able find water by herself.

00:05:05.470 --> 00:05:09.720
So she always brought
those leaves back just for us.

00:05:11.060 --> 00:05:13.930
I don't see any Red Bugs,
but you never know.

00:05:14.520 --> 00:05:15.600
We have to be careful.

00:05:17.690 --> 00:05:19.980
Rin-san seems to be a bit tense.

00:05:20.150 --> 00:05:21.730
No bugs, huh?

00:05:21.900 --> 00:05:24.780
Maybe there are
some other dangerous things.

00:05:25.490 --> 00:05:31.410
Every time we went somewhere new,
it caused a lot of pain for Rin.

00:05:32.950 --> 00:05:36.080
You mean, how somebody always died?

00:05:36.250 --> 00:05:40.040
She's always looking out for us.

00:05:40.250 --> 00:05:43.550
I want Rin to be able to relax too.

00:05:43.710 --> 00:05:47.340
Find something she likes and wind down.

00:05:47.510 --> 00:05:49.970
If only we can find some water...

00:05:50.600 --> 00:05:54.060
You're right. Once we do,
it'll be much easier for her.

00:05:54.220 --> 00:05:59.980
Rin actually liked to explore new places,
just like you.

00:06:00.150 --> 00:06:01.860
She did?

00:06:02.610 --> 00:06:06.570
But each time we did,
something bad happened.

00:06:19.080 --> 00:06:20.750
Something is there.

00:06:20.920 --> 00:06:23.040
Ai-chan is pointing that way too.

00:06:25.050 --> 00:06:28.800
Huh? I see a light of some sort.

00:06:42.150 --> 00:06:45.030
-Is this...?
-A wall?

00:06:45.190 --> 00:06:49.400
A wall? Like the ones between the islands?

00:06:49.570 --> 00:06:54.120
Yes, but this one
doesn't have a hole in it.

00:06:54.780 --> 00:06:59.040
What should we do?
Ryo-chan broke it for us last time.

00:06:59.460 --> 00:07:03.170
Oh, so that's what the blue one is for?

00:07:03.340 --> 00:07:05.500
Yeah, that's right.

00:07:06.210 --> 00:07:09.010
The water should be past this wall.

00:07:09.470 --> 00:07:12.340
Then we'll have to smash a hole in it.

00:07:15.310 --> 00:07:16.310
What's wrong?

00:07:16.470 --> 00:07:19.680
There were 6 of us last time.

00:07:19.850 --> 00:07:24.230
And still, it took Ryo-chan
a long time to break through it.

00:07:24.400 --> 00:07:28.230
I think this one is
thicker than last time.

00:07:29.610 --> 00:07:31.910
Anyways, let's give it a try.

00:07:47.170 --> 00:07:49.210
-It's no use.
-Not one scratch.

00:07:49.380 --> 00:07:51.260
-So irritating!
-Yeah!

00:07:51.680 --> 00:07:54.840
Not even a scratch
after everyone attacked it?

00:07:55.010 --> 00:07:57.970
Wow, how did you break it last time?

00:07:58.140 --> 00:07:59.520
Last time...

00:07:59.680 --> 00:08:03.100
You're right.
I'll have to use the main body.

00:08:03.310 --> 00:08:04.100
Rin!

00:08:07.150 --> 00:08:10.150
Rin, no! We'll think of another way.

00:08:10.320 --> 00:08:13.610
There isn't much water left.
I have to do what I can...

00:08:26.750 --> 00:08:28.960
What's going on? They're like Red Bugs.

00:08:31.460 --> 00:08:33.430
They're going to attack. Get ready!

00:08:45.730 --> 00:08:47.440
Are you all okay?

00:08:47.650 --> 00:08:49.520
Jeez, what are they?

00:08:49.690 --> 00:08:52.110
We can fight them, but there are too many.

00:08:56.570 --> 00:08:57.870
-It's...
-A big one!

00:08:58.030 --> 00:08:59.160
Might be Nushi.

00:09:02.120 --> 00:09:03.500
Huh? This wall...

00:09:04.580 --> 00:09:07.330
How to use the blue one...

00:09:14.630 --> 00:09:17.760
We can pass through here! This way!

00:09:20.180 --> 00:09:22.520
-Huh?
-How did you...?

00:09:22.680 --> 00:09:25.350
I think we can pass through. Come on!

00:09:35.150 --> 00:09:36.400
Ouch...

00:09:36.570 --> 00:09:39.320
Phew, that was a close one.

00:09:39.490 --> 00:09:41.240
Did everyone make it?

00:09:41.410 --> 00:09:43.450
Yeah, we're all okay.

00:09:45.370 --> 00:09:46.460
Where are we?

00:09:51.920 --> 00:09:55.380
What did you just do?
Did you break the wall?

00:09:55.760 --> 00:09:58.680
It reacted like Kemurikusa for a second.

00:09:59.090 --> 00:10:01.640
So I thought I could use it the same way.

00:10:02.100 --> 00:10:03.850
But, where are we?

00:10:07.560 --> 00:10:09.900
-It's kind of bright in here.
-Yeah.

00:10:10.060 --> 00:10:12.480
It's really quiet too.

00:10:14.860 --> 00:10:16.780
-Whoa!
-Ai-chan.

00:10:18.070 --> 00:10:21.700
I've never seen her so lively.
Do you think...?

00:10:21.870 --> 00:10:23.280
There just might be!

00:10:27.080 --> 00:10:28.120
Let's go.

00:11:12.580 --> 00:11:15.590
-It's water!
-Yay!

00:11:23.850 --> 00:11:25.260
It really is water.

00:11:26.390 --> 00:11:27.930
We did it, Rin!

00:11:29.100 --> 00:11:31.140
Can we drink it?

00:11:31.480 --> 00:11:32.480
Yeah.

00:11:32.770 --> 00:11:36.650
Look at all this water.
This will last us for a while.

00:11:37.070 --> 00:11:38.820
There's more coming out too.

00:11:38.990 --> 00:11:41.150
Wow, it's a river.

00:11:41.570 --> 00:11:42.950
Let's collect the water.

00:11:43.160 --> 00:11:45.740
We should just live here.

00:11:45.950 --> 00:11:47.490
No Red Bugs, either.

00:11:48.410 --> 00:11:50.910
We won't have to worry anymore.

00:11:51.500 --> 00:11:53.920
Good work, everyone.

00:11:54.630 --> 00:11:59.300
I bet Sis Riku, Ryo-chan,
and Ryoku-chan will...

00:12:00.380 --> 00:12:03.470
You won't have to
put yourself in danger anymore.

00:12:03.640 --> 00:12:06.350
I always made you carry all the weight.

00:12:06.510 --> 00:12:08.310
Don't say that.

00:12:08.470 --> 00:12:12.190
You can take care of Midori
all you want now.

00:12:18.860 --> 00:12:20.320
It's so pretty.

00:12:20.490 --> 00:12:23.950
-So much!
-And it was dry everywhere else.

00:12:24.110 --> 00:12:28.580
I think this tree is drawing up
the water from the island.

00:12:35.120 --> 00:12:37.590
He sure does like Kemurikusa.

00:12:37.750 --> 00:12:41.300
Is there any Rina can eat? Gimme!

00:12:44.760 --> 00:12:46.470
What should we do now?

00:12:46.640 --> 00:12:52.140
For now, let's rest up and
stretch out Midori-chan's roots.

00:12:52.310 --> 00:12:55.730
Usually, we'd be on the lookout
for Red Bugs.

00:12:55.900 --> 00:12:59.610
But they probably can't get in
past that wall.

00:12:59.860 --> 00:13:00.780
No red fog, either.

00:13:00.940 --> 00:13:03.150
What a wonderful place.

00:13:03.360 --> 00:13:05.740
Let's make this our new base.

00:13:05.910 --> 00:13:11.040
The running water seems stable too.
It might last even longer than it looks.

00:13:11.290 --> 00:13:13.870
Finally, mission accomplished.

00:13:14.710 --> 00:13:19.460
I'd never imagined this to be possible.
I don't know what to do.

00:13:19.710 --> 00:13:22.880
First, I'm going to give
Midori-chan lots of water.

00:13:23.050 --> 00:13:24.970
She's going to be so happy.

00:13:25.130 --> 00:13:29.050
She might grow even bigger.
And then, and then...

00:13:35.520 --> 00:13:37.560
There's a lot around here.

00:13:38.770 --> 00:13:41.190
So this tree is drawing up the water.

00:13:41.400 --> 00:13:44.900
It must've taken a long time
for it to grow this big.

00:13:45.860 --> 00:13:47.360
Here's another.

00:13:47.530 --> 00:13:49.620
You can eat this one. Right, Wakaba?

00:13:49.780 --> 00:13:51.870
No, the color is a bit different.

00:13:52.040 --> 00:13:54.290
But it's really pretty. Where was it?

00:14:03.420 --> 00:14:04.920
What's that?

00:14:05.420 --> 00:14:06.470
What's wrong?

00:14:07.180 --> 00:14:10.090
Can I go take a look around?

00:14:10.260 --> 00:14:13.640
I want to check the surroundings too.
I'll go with you.

00:14:18.900 --> 00:14:23.070
I'm guessing the tree
is roughly the center of Island Seven.

00:14:32.120 --> 00:14:37.910
This would've never happened
if we hadn't left Island One.

00:14:41.830 --> 00:14:44.550
There's a wall on the other side too.

00:14:44.710 --> 00:14:48.090
That means Red Bugs
can't come in from there, either.

00:14:49.470 --> 00:14:50.550
What is it?

00:14:50.720 --> 00:14:55.100
It's kind of thanks to you
that we made it here.

00:14:55.720 --> 00:14:58.390
So, uh, thanks.

00:14:58.560 --> 00:15:02.560
Oh no, it's all because
you fought so much for us.

00:15:04.900 --> 00:15:06.070
There it is again.

00:15:06.360 --> 00:15:07.690
What is it?

00:15:07.860 --> 00:15:09.200
Let's go check.

00:15:13.120 --> 00:15:16.410
It's really high over here too.

00:15:16.580 --> 00:15:18.250
Is it fixed on a branch?

00:15:18.410 --> 00:15:20.410
Is this the same as where we came in?

00:15:20.580 --> 00:15:22.380
It looks like it.

00:15:22.540 --> 00:15:25.090
I think I can open it the same way.

00:15:25.960 --> 00:15:27.800
Can I give it a try?

00:15:28.380 --> 00:15:29.420
Do it.

00:15:32.140 --> 00:15:33.390
Yes, it opened.

00:15:38.560 --> 00:15:39.730
What?

00:15:51.450 --> 00:15:53.240
R-Rin-san...

00:15:53.780 --> 00:15:55.120
Impossible...

00:16:08.340 --> 00:16:11.550
They'll reach the water at this rate.

00:16:26.060 --> 00:16:27.270
Oh wow...

00:16:34.910 --> 00:16:38.580
Rin-san, that red root!
The Red Bugs are coming from it!

00:16:38.740 --> 00:16:39.990
This rotten thing!

00:16:50.510 --> 00:16:53.170
Rin-san, let's turn back
and notify Ritsu-san.

00:16:53.420 --> 00:16:54.430
Damn it.

00:17:07.100 --> 00:17:09.900
If all that falls down, the water...

00:17:10.150 --> 00:17:12.240
And this thick red fog...

00:17:12.900 --> 00:17:15.070
Damn it...damn it!

00:17:16.410 --> 00:17:17.490
Rin-san...

00:17:22.540 --> 00:17:24.000
You're back.

00:17:25.120 --> 00:17:28.420
-Look, Midori-chan grew bigger!
-Yeah!

00:17:28.580 --> 00:17:30.840
See how shiny she is?

00:17:31.050 --> 00:17:34.880
She just drank up, so she's glowing.
How cute is that!

00:17:35.880 --> 00:17:37.890
Rin, what's wrong?

00:17:38.220 --> 00:17:41.100
-What's wrong?
-You look gloomy.

00:17:41.560 --> 00:17:43.770
The thing is...

00:17:44.930 --> 00:17:46.230
How could that be...?

00:17:49.520 --> 00:17:52.230
And I thought we were all safe now.

00:17:52.400 --> 00:17:54.780
What about that other root?

00:17:55.400 --> 00:17:59.950
A huge red root was generating
the red fog and Red Bugs.

00:18:00.240 --> 00:18:04.000
If we don't do something,
it's never going to stop.

00:18:04.160 --> 00:18:07.830
The root regenerated too.
How do we stop it?

00:18:08.330 --> 00:18:14.300
Like Midori-chan, it must have
a core branch in the main body's trunk.

00:18:14.920 --> 00:18:19.430
If we can find it,
I think we can stop it for good.

00:18:19.590 --> 00:18:23.100
I think I saw something past the island.

00:18:23.510 --> 00:18:26.140
But I'm not sure just how far it was.

00:18:26.350 --> 00:18:29.100
And all those Red Bugs...

00:18:35.690 --> 00:18:37.070
What should we do?

00:18:38.110 --> 00:18:39.910
We've found water.

00:18:40.280 --> 00:18:42.830
We can live for a while
on what we can carry.

00:18:43.490 --> 00:18:46.580
Let's collect it and
go back somewhere safe.

00:18:54.460 --> 00:18:56.760
What do you want to do, Rin-san?

00:18:57.970 --> 00:19:01.390
If there's something you want to do...

00:19:01.590 --> 00:19:06.770
It's not in my position to say this,
but I think everybody wants to hear it.

00:19:07.140 --> 00:19:08.480
-Yeah.
-Yeah!

00:19:11.060 --> 00:19:12.310
I...

00:19:13.110 --> 00:19:16.480
I want to find out the cause
and do something about it.

00:19:17.150 --> 00:19:19.030
So we don't live in fear.

00:19:19.530 --> 00:19:23.070
I want for us to be able to live in peace.

00:19:24.700 --> 00:19:27.790
Just now, for just a second...

00:19:28.000 --> 00:19:32.000
I saw you all truly at ease
for the first time.

00:19:34.670 --> 00:19:37.510
But I know this world isn't so easy.

00:19:37.670 --> 00:19:41.180
And someone might die again
because I make a wrong move.

00:19:41.880 --> 00:19:44.890
There might not be any good to be gained.

00:19:45.100 --> 00:19:46.260
There is.

00:19:46.430 --> 00:19:49.730
There were lots of dangers coming here.

00:19:49.980 --> 00:19:52.190
And I had to rely on you to protect me.

00:19:52.440 --> 00:19:56.360
But look how much I've discovered.

00:19:56.520 --> 00:19:58.820
And how much I've learned to do.

00:19:59.440 --> 00:20:02.950
I might not be of much use to you yet.

00:20:03.280 --> 00:20:07.450
But we've found water,
and I can do more things than before.

00:20:07.740 --> 00:20:10.370
I'm sure we can live peacefully.

00:20:10.540 --> 00:20:13.250
I know it. So let's all try.

00:20:16.540 --> 00:20:21.050
He's right. We've come this far.
Let's all do what we can together.

00:20:21.220 --> 00:20:24.010
-Yeah!
-You can count on Rina-chan too.

00:20:26.850 --> 00:20:30.520
So we have to find the trunk
of that red one, right?

00:20:30.720 --> 00:20:36.190
Roots can't be used once they're cut,
so we'll just have to follow it.

00:20:36.360 --> 00:20:39.020
Okay, I'll go then.

00:20:39.570 --> 00:20:43.240
I'll take care of that trunk,
so you all stay here.

00:20:43.700 --> 00:20:45.200
If the red fog comes...

00:20:45.360 --> 00:20:46.990
Don't be silly.

00:20:47.700 --> 00:20:49.870
We're in this together.

00:20:51.040 --> 00:20:53.710
Didn't you hear what we were saying?

00:20:53.910 --> 00:20:56.330
It'll be safer with Midori-chan around.

00:20:56.540 --> 00:20:59.250
But that thick red fog and the Red Bugs...

00:20:59.420 --> 00:21:04.630
If this place is in danger, we'll have
a better chance if we all go together.

00:21:04.930 --> 00:21:06.300
If we die, we die.

00:21:06.510 --> 00:21:09.850
If we're to live in peace,
you have to be there too.

00:21:10.010 --> 00:21:12.180
You can be such a dummy sometimes.

00:21:15.140 --> 00:21:16.940
How about you, Wakaba-kun?

00:21:17.100 --> 00:21:19.690
It'll be dangerous either way, but...

00:21:20.440 --> 00:21:23.530
Sorry, I wasn't listening.

00:21:23.690 --> 00:21:26.530
I was thinking how I should take these.

00:21:26.700 --> 00:21:28.990
I hope they come in handy.

00:21:29.160 --> 00:21:31.330
He's getting ready to go already.

00:21:31.490 --> 00:21:33.790
He'll be the first to die, though.

00:21:34.210 --> 00:21:35.790
That's the kind of guy he is.

00:21:35.960 --> 00:21:38.420
Yes, you're right about that.

00:21:44.420 --> 00:21:46.380
Find the red tree and destroy it.

00:21:46.550 --> 00:21:49.050
Follow the root and reach it.

00:21:49.220 --> 00:21:50.890
Got lots of water!

00:21:51.060 --> 00:21:54.430
Midori-chan's had plenty of water too.

00:21:54.730 --> 00:21:57.060
She's grown all the leaves she can.

00:21:57.650 --> 00:22:00.520
We'll use what we have
to destroy the trunk.
